{"parentUuid":"671ee14e-e51d-4417-ac9c-ea3a9954aae6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01BTb5CsBS1xmz5uEy11jx7y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's where everything stands. The **panic is fixed** — your trace pointed at the *pre-fix* line (163 = old `SetColumns`); the freshly rebuilt `/tmp/entire-brain` (23:39) has the fix, and `TestTabCycleNoPanic` now cycles all 6 tabs both directions so it can't regress.\n\n## What I did this turn\n\n**1. Tab-cycle crash (the one you hit)** — root cause: `switchTab` swapped to the new tab's columns while the table still held the old tab's wider rows. Fixed (`SetRows(nil)` before `SetColumns`) and regression-tested. You were running a stale binary.\n\n**2. Search in the TUI** (Thomas's main ask — \"trigger entire brain search from the TUI\"):\n- Press **`s`** anywhere → a search prompt → results land on a new **Search** tab, each with a detail page (source, id, path:line, full match text, score).\n- It calls the *same* `retrieveUnified` that powers `entire brain search` (lexical over facts + history + docs). Runs async so the UI never blocks. Verified the core returns real hits on this brain (docs + history).\n- `--tab search` preselects it; `o` opens a result's source.\n\n**3. `entire brain add <repo_url>`** (the \"don't clone manually\" convenience):\n- Clones the repo, fetches its Entire history (`refs/heads/entire/*`), and builds the brain by running `refresh` against the clone. Then explore with `entire brain dash`/`status`/`search` from inside it.\n- `--dir`, `--build=false` (clone only), `--checkpoint-limit`.\n\n**Verification so far:** `go build`, `go vet`, full `go test ./...`, and `-race` on the new packages — all green. New tests: `TestTabCycleNoPanic`, `TestSearchPopulatesSearchTab`, `TestSearchDisabledWhenNoFunc`, `TestRepoDirName`, `TestIsGitCheckout`, plus the earlier regression tests. Live smoke confirms search + plain/json work on the real brain.\n\n**Final verification in flight:** I launched a second focused audit (`/workflows` to watch) over the search state machine, `add`, and the four prior fixes — since a real crash slipped past my own checks last time, I'm not calling it \"verified properly\" until the adversarial pass clears it. I'll report findings and fix anything confirmed, then it's ready for your review (still uncommitted on `claude/brain-dash-tui`)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5649,"cache_read_input_tokens":391868,"output_tokens":843,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5649,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":843,"cache_read_input_tokens":391868,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5649,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5649},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cc88z2vyZvGUDCYqQxFeb","type":"assistant","uuid":"69a0acc6-2086-4dae-8b2a-9f221d27f79d","timestamp":"2026-06-17T03:41:08.369Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/brain-dash-tui","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
