{"parentUuid":"481b2cd1-5f7e-4025-840e-83219e6250ca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01FdvK7EbRyXRnt9gaF4QaS4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both done.\n\n## entire-judge — brain-path fix ✅ pushed\n- Branch **`claude/judge-brain-path-fix`** on `suhaanthayyil/entire-judge` (commit `02971d8`).\n- `judge run`/`rank` now resolve the brain under the **brain plugin's** data dir (`…/data/brain/repos/…`, where `entire brain refresh` writes — Thomas's path), falling back to judge's own dir for `judge add`-built brains. This directly fixes his `brain_missing` error.\n- It's on a branch (not `main`) — merge it when you're ready and Thomas's `entire judge run /…/entire-brain` will work.\n\n## entire-brain — dashboard TUI ✅ PR opened\n- **PR #45**: https://github.com/ashtom/entire-brain/pull/45 (`claude/brain-dash-tui` → `main`, commit `b3076b57`).\n- `entire brain dash` (Home + Facts/Sessions/History/Semantic/**Search** tabs, themes, filter, mouse, `o` to open source) + `entire brain add <repo-url>`.\n- All 6 audit-confirmed bugs across both audits are fixed and regression-tested; build/vet/test/`-race` green.\n\nThe \"6 uncommitted changes\" warning on the PR is just the local tooling dirs (`.regente/`, `.cursor/`, etc.) — untracked and correctly excluded from the commit.\n\nWant me to open a PR for the entire-judge fix too (or is the branch enough), and should I merge it so Thomas can use `entire judge run` right away?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1318,"cache_read_input_tokens":463290,"output_tokens":1298,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1318,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1298,"cache_read_input_tokens":463290,"cache_creation