{"parentUuid":"0182b0a4-d771-4293-86d8-9062193ab346","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01KYBYpLAgheF6Sr55nng1Ug","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012EMjTWT7h1y3HnMKwqLR3J","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain\ngit add internal/cli/add.go internal/cli/dash.go internal/cli/dash_test.go internal/tui/tui.go internal/tui/tui_test.go\ngit diff --cached --stat\ngit commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(dash): address PR review feedback\n\n- add: a failed brain build now returns a non-zero error (keeping the clone on\n  disk) instead of exiting 0, so scripts/CI don't treat a failed build as success.\n- dash: include the `search` tab in the --tab flag help and the unknown_tab error.\n- tui: exit search mode immediately on submit and drop stale (out-of-order) async\n  results via an in-flight query guard, so repeated Enter can't enqueue overlapping\n  searches.\n- dash: sanitize the semantic snapshot FilePath through the shared containment\n  helper before using it as an `o`-open target, so a tampered snapshot can't open\n  files outside the repo. Renamed brainRelPath -> containedPath (now used for both\n  brain- and repo-relative paths).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1\necho \"=== push ===\"; git push origin claude/brain-dash-tui 2>&1 | tail -4","description":"Commit and push the Copilot-feedback fixes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":775,"cache_read_input_tokens":521245,"output_tokens":543,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":775,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":543,"cache_read_input_tokens":521245,"cach