{"parentUuid":"2c8d4187-b719-485d-989d-bf350a97dbfd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01DFcRkEjEZgaqydSEQh7xoV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's a Discord-ready message, no em dashes:\n\n```\ntried #44. the corpus side is great, patterns refresh built in ~5s token free and surfaced real stuff from my sessions (validation_loop, no_egress, review_request, the git procedures). actually useful.\n\none thing though: `patterns skills` comes back empty even with 46 task patterns. looks like skill candidates need a task with a dossier, but dossiers only build at strength >= 0.65 and my strongest task is 0.62, so none qualify. only a risk and one procedure cleared the bar.\n\nalso the task patterns are mostly git command sequences (git push > git status) rather than real intent tasks, so even dropping the threshold would just surface low value ones first.\n\nmaybe seed dossiers for the top N tasks regardless of threshold, or weight intent tasks above command sequences? corpus itself is solid\n```"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":991,"cache_read_input_tokens":563628,"output_tokens":1407,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":991,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":131,"output_tokens":1407,"cache_read_input_tokens":563628,"cache_creation_input_tokens":991,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":991},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cc9AKrh13JqRaZoKvb73i","type":"assistant","uuid":"1b6a5525-9473-44a2-8c0d-b3aaad771866","timestamp":"2026-06-17T16:39:26.968Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d