{"parentUuid":"d3c100c9-2b7a-4fa5-80b0-d2ed83818bd8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ec8f35a2-4ed1-4e71-bb7f-71f323abba37","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DkyLNQhkT4atYBbkUCwwBh","type":"tool_result","content":"=== distill --help ===\nDistill captured sessions into durable facts (agent-required)\n\nUsage:\n  entire-brain distill [path] [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --agent string                Distillation agent: auto, codex, claude-code, ollama, or command (default \"auto\")\n      --agent-command stringArray   Agent command argv for --agent command\n      --branch string               Limit distillation to a single branch (default: all exported branches)\n      --concurrency int             Distill agent calls to run in flight at once, shared across sessions (1 = strictly sequential; higher values may add one concurrent reconcile call) (default 4)\n      --confidence float            Minimum agent confidence to auto-apply a merge/supersede; below this it is queued for review (default 0.75)\n      --dry-run                     Estimate distill work without calling an agent or writing facts\n      --effort string               Override the reasoning effort for codex/claude-code (e.g. low) — pairs with --model for a cheap run\n      --force                       Recompute all distilled facts from scratch instead of skipping unchanged sessions\n  -h, --help                        help for distill\n      --jobs int                    Compatibility alias for --concurrency\n      --json                        Emit the fact source summary as JSON\n      --max-chunk-bytes int         Transcript chunk size in bytes; larger chunks mean fewer agent calls per session (long-context models handle 128-192KB comfortably) (default 49152)\n      --model string                Override the agent model for codex/claude-code, or select the local Ollama model\n      --session string              Limit distillation to a single session id (the fast per