{"parentUuid":"ffb08716-89fa-4858-9a71-d65fab319171","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01MCk8MyJEHd9WQ7Gq9nUo8C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Ran distill on `main` (244 facts), rebuilt the corpus, and `patterns skills` is **still empty** — and I found exactly why. Two layers:\n\n1. The recurring tasks are all generic git command sequences, which the corpus *deliberately* holds diagnostic — so they correctly never become skills (it's not \"betraying itself\" there).\n2. More importantly, the 244 facts produced **0 `episode_facts` links**. The fact→episode linking matches a fact's *locus* against the files an episode touched, but the distilled facts are mostly conceptual (`architecture.*`, `seed/intake`) with empty or non-file locus — so nothing overlapped, and the fact-corroboration lever that's supposed to promote a task never engaged. (Practices did jump 0→238, so facts landed elsewhere.)\n\nSo distill confirms his \"1000 patterns, no useful skills\" take, and surfaces a concrete gap: distilled facts aren't linking to episodes by file, so they can't corroborate tasks even in principle.\n\nDiscord reply to send (short, no em dashes):\n\n```\nran distill on main, got 244 facts, rebuilt the corpus. patterns skills still empty.\n\ndug into why, two things. the recurring tasks are all generic git command seqs which the corpus deliberately keeps diagnostic, so they correctly never become skills (so it's not betraying itself there). but also the 244 facts produced 0 episode_facts links. the linking matches fact locus against the files an episode touched, and the distilled facts are mostly conceptual (architecture.*, seed/intake) with empty or non file locus, so nothing overlapped. so the fact corroboration that's meant to promote a task never fired.\n\nnet: facts went in and bumped practices 0 to 238, but the task path saw zero corroboration so still no skills. lines up with your 1000 patterns no skills take. the one real gap imo is distilled facts not linking to episodes by file, so they cant corroborate tasks even when they should\n```\n\nNote: the brain now has those 244 main-branch facts (additive, from the distill you asked for) plus the built pattern corpus, if you want to keep poking with `/tmp/entire-brain-v44`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4165,"cache_read_input_tokens":587061,"output_tokens":2896,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4165,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":131,"output_tokens":2896,"cache_read_input_tokens":587061,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4165,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4165},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cc9Eand4pMDkE174bjcDb","type":"assistant","uuid":"757afa5b-02a1-4102-aa48-74ca30e3826f","timestamp":"2026-06-17T17:35:34.636Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/brain-dash-tui","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
