{"parentUuid":"8bed7a98-d5f8-4b70-8bce-62235eeb4cae","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Mu8oV8JcdDZtNLdqQsNzNf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This is exactly the precision I needed. The critical insight from the gate + why-0of3 maps: **a correctness-axis proof is achievable at n≈4–8, not n=16** — because pass-rate lift needs only `pass_cond > pass_base` + drop-one survival (no Holm p-test), unlike the token-efficiency path. The 0/3 suites failed because either the baseline was *saturated* (no_brain already 100%) or the brain arm itself wasn't 100% pass. So the honest recipe is sharp and feasible:\n\n> A task whose decisive answer lives in the brain (history rationale / durable fact / semantic locator) and is **not** reliably recoverable from the repo alone → no_brain fails (<100%), with-brain reliably passes (100%) → clean correctness_win at n≥4.\n\nThat's tens of `claude` calls, not hundreds — genuinely runnable here. Let me read the remaining two maps (distill-perf, ledger-gates)."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27467,"cache_read_input_tokens":107982,"output_tokens":5766,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27467,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":5766,"cache_read_input_tokens":107982,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27467,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27467},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcB6su1LaU1EYqRMdWR6t","type":"assistant","uuid":"a376555e-a450-476e-bcab-b6676878cc39","timestamp":"2026-06-18T17:16:21.468Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7