{"parentUuid":"ef2da18c-6d1d-4bc1-aa84-489c178ae67f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_017YfAgpiDUq3eSf6h9iwRKM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I now have the complete, exact map of all five gate layers. Let me lock in the synthesis before executing:\n\n**P0.2 (distill timing)** — highly feasible and fully completable here: `distill --dry-run --json` is offline; paired `--jobs 1`/`--jobs N` can run via the deterministic `--agent command` path (exactly how the existing evidence was made) **plus** a bounded hosted-model (`--agent claude-code`) corroboration. The open work is to redo this on the **large target repo (entireio/cli, found locally)** with a new manifest `target` block + widened `claim_scope`, then pass `audit_distill_perf.py`.\n\n**P0.1 (replay-lab proof-ready)** — the sharp, honest recipe: author tasks where the decisive answer lives in the brain (history rationale / durable fact / semantic locator) and is *not* recoverable from the repo in budget → **no_brain arm fails (<100%), brain arm reliably passes (100%)** → clean `correctness_win` → `brain_positive_stable` at n≥4 (pass-rate lift needs only drop-one survival, no Holm). Validate offline (leak-audit + fails-as-expected), pilot to confirm real headroom, scale, and register **only if genuinely earned**.\n\nLet me lock these into tracked tasks and run the hard feasibility checks the whole plan depends on (entire-sem sibling, source repos, offline `run.py check`)."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16752,"cache_read_input_tokens":135449,"output_tokens":6855,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16752,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":6855,"cache_read_input_tokens":135449