{"parentUuid":"f9ddb4c3-cd20-4265-868f-cd7c9f72d458","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"64","subject":"P0.2 offline: large-repo distill timing on entireio/cli","description":"Run `distill --dry-run --json` (offline) on the entireio/cli large corpus (822 sessions / 1.6G) for real large-repo sizing, plus paired timed --jobs 1 vs --jobs N via --agent command + local-command-agent (deterministic, no model) on a temp brain copy. Produces dry-run.json/jobs-1.json/jobs-N.json with matching cache/timing fields. No hosted-model usage.","activeForm":"Running offline large-repo distill timing","status":"in_progress","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"65","subject":"P0.2: build distill-perf manifest + pass audit_distill_perf.py","description":"Author a new evidence manifest with a target block for github.com/entireio/cli and widened claim_scope (large-repo command-agent scheduler speedup), retain artifacts + go-test ollama contract, run audit_distill_perf.py to PASS. Then update press release Proven/Pending lines + eval_ledger row + regenerate release-matrix distill track. Honest scope: command-agent measures scheduler parallelism; note hosted-model latency is separate.","activeForm":"Building distill-perf manifest and passing the auditor","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"66","subject":"P0.1 author: harder/clean correctness-axis replay-lab tasks","description":"Author 3-5 candidate tasks where the decisive answer lives in the brain (history rationale / durable fact / semantic locator) and is NOT recoverable from the repo in budget, so no_brain fails (<100%) and brain reliably passes (100%) → clean correctness_win at n>=4. Symptom-level brain_queries (pass brain_query_leak_audit), hide validation+expected, leak_markers + agent_hidden_paths, pinned base_commit. Templates from existing tasks/*.json.","activeForm":"Authoring harder/clean replay-lab tasks","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"67","subject"