{"parentUuid":"c98180fe-f00f-4cec-9bac-18e0b6a5ff6c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"64","subject":"P0.2 offline: large-repo distill timing on entireio/cli","description":"Run `distill --dry-run --json` (offline) on the entireio/cli large corpus (822 sessions / 1.6G) for real large-repo sizing, plus paired timed --jobs 1 vs --jobs N via --agent command + local-command-agent (deterministic, no model) on a temp brain copy. Produces dry-run.json/jobs-1.json/jobs-N.json with matching cache/timing fields. No hosted-model usage.","activeForm":"Running offline large-repo distill timing","status":"in_progress","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"65","subject":"P0.2: build distill-perf manifest + pass audit_distill_perf.py","description":"Author a new evidence manifest with a target block for github.com/entireio/cli and widened claim_scope (large-repo command-agent scheduler speedup), retain artifacts + go-test ollama contract, run audit_distill_perf.py to PASS. Then update press release Proven/Pending lines + eval_ledger row + regenerate release-matrix distill track. Honest scope: command-agent measures scheduler parallelism; note hosted-model latency is separate.","activeForm":"Building distill-perf manifest and passing the auditor","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"66","subject":"P0.1 author: harder/clean correctness-axis replay-lab tasks","description":"Author 3-5 candidate tasks where the decisive answer lives in the brain (history rationale / durable fact / semantic locator) and is NOT recoverable from the repo in budget, so no_brain fails (<100%) and brain reliably passes (100%) → clean correctness_win at n>=4. Symptom-level brain_queries (pass brain_query_leak_audit), hide validation+expected, leak_markers + agent_hidden_paths, pinned base_commit. Templates from existing tasks/*.json.","activeForm":"Authoring harder/clean replay-lab tasks","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"67","subject":"P0.1 offline-validate: leak-audit clean + fails-as-expected + panel","description":"For each candidate task: run `run.py check` (offline, no model) to confirm the regression fails-as-expected, and confirm brain_query_leak_audit passes (no answer-bearing identifiers/phrases). Iterate JSON until clean. Build a panel JSON sized for n>=4-8/side. All offline — no hosted-model usage.","activeForm":"Offline-validating tasks (leak-audit + fails-as-expected)","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"68","subject":"P0.1 (post-2PM): run pilots → scale n>=4-8 → check proof_ready","description":"HOSTED-MODEL, run only after 2 PM limit reset. Run no_brain difficulty pilots (confirm baseline fails / score <90), then brain-arm direction pilots, drop saturated tasks, scale survivors to n>=4-8/side, let run.py compute proof_ready. Drives the session-authed claude/codex CLI.","activeForm":"Running pilots and scaling to proof-ready n","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"69","subject":"P0.1 (post-2PM): register genuine proofs or honest negative","description":"If a suite genuinely flips proof_ready: copy into evidence/release/ matching release_citable_suite_globs, flip manifest claim_policy no_release_claim→proof_required with required_proof_scopes, regenerate codex-audit + release-matrix reports, add eval_ledger row, update press release. If it does NOT flip: document the honest negative finding + what was learned. NEVER fabricate numbers.","activeForm":"Registering genuine proofs (or honest negative)","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"70","subject":"Loop-audit until clean (bugbot-proof)","description":"go build/vet/test/gofmt clean; run full `mise run release:readiness` (all auditors + cmp staleness) green; adversarial self-review workflow over new tasks/manifests/docs for leakage, provenance gaps, stale reports, doc-claim mismatches, schema typos, no person-names; loop until dry. Review-before-push (do not push without user review).","activeForm":"Loop-auditing until no issues remain","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":7},"type":"attachment","uuid":"00e13b31-834b-4549-9a09-744f9bedf8e5","timestamp":"2026-06-18T17:46:05.220Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
