\"retained large-repo distill performance evidence report is stale: $report\" >&2\n              diff -u \"$committed\" \"$generated\" >&2 || true\n              exit 1\n            fi\n          done\n          for report in facts-eval-audit-report.json facts-eval-audit-report.md; do","originalFile":"name: test\n\non:\n  push:\n  pull_request:\n\njobs:\n  lint:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6.0.2\n      - uses: actions/setup-go@v6.4.0\n        with: { go-version: \"1.26.2\" }\n      - run: go vet ./...\n      - run: |\n          unformatted=$(gofmt -l -s .)\n          if [ -n \"$unformatted\" ]; then\n            echo \"::error::unformatted files:\"\n            echo \"$unformatted\"\n            exit 1\n          fi\n\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        goos: [darwin, linux, windows]\n        goarch: [amd64, arm64]\n        exclude:\n          - { goos: windows, goarch: arm64 }\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6.0.2\n      - uses: actions/setup-go@v6.4.0\n        with: { go-version: \"1.26.2\" }\n      - env:\n          GOOS: ${{ matrix.goos }}\n          GOARCH: ${{ matrix.goarch }}\n        run: go build ./...\n\n  test:\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6.0.2\n      - uses: actions/setup-go@v6.4.0\n        with: { go-version: \"1.26.2\" }\n      - run: go test -race ./...\n\n  # Stage 1b cgo stack: mattn/go-sqlite3 + sqlite-vec (vec0) + FTS5. The\n  # default jobs above stay pure-Go and prove the cgo-less fallback; this lane\n  # proves the cgo stack on the platforms with a stock C toolchain. Windows\n  # cgo (mingw) is a deferred follow-up — Windows users get the pure-Go build.\n  test-cgo:\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest]\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    env:\n      CGO_ENABLED: \"1\"\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6.0.2\n      - uses: actions/setup-go@v6.4.0\n        with: { go-version: \"1.26.2\" }\n      - run: go test -tags \"brain_cgo sqlite_fts5\" ./...\n\n  phase1-semantic:\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    env:\n      ENTIRE_BRAIN_PHASE1_CI: \"1\"\n      GOPROXY: \"off\"\n      GOSUMDB: \"off\"\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6.0.2\n      - uses: actions/setup-go@v6.4.0\n        with: { go-version: \"1.26.2\" }\n      - name: Prime module cache\n        env:\n          GOPROXY: \"https://proxy.golang.org,direct\"\n          GOSUMDB: \"sum.golang.org\"\n        run: go mod download\n      - name: Run deterministic Phase 1 semantic tests\n        run: go test -race ./internal/cli -run 'TestPhase1|TestSemantic|TestWorkspace|TestMCP|TestRefreshSemantic'\n\n  release-evidence:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6.0.2\n      - name: Check retained release evidence\n        run: |\n          set -e\n          python3 benchmarks/agent-brain/run_test.py\n          tmp=\"$(mktemp -d)\"\n          trap 'rm -rf \"$tmp\"' EXIT\n          python3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_codex.py \\\n            --results benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/release \\\n            --release-manifest benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/release/manifest.json \\\n            --out-dir \"$tmp\" \\\n            --fail-on-flags\n          python3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_radar_evidence.py \\\n            --results benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/release \\\n            --suite-glob 'release-candidate-*' \\\n            --out-dir \"$tmp\" \\\n            --codex-audit-report \"$tmp/codex-audit-report.json\" \\\n            --fail-when-no-proof\n          python3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_radar_tool_evidence.py \\\n            --manifest benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/radar-tool/manifest.json \\\n            --repo-root . \\\n            --out-dir \"$tmp\" \\\n            --fail-on-flags\n          python3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_workspace_radar_evidence.py \\\n            --manifest benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/workspace-radar/manifest.json \\\n            --out-dir \"$tmp\" \\\n            --fail-on-flags\n          python3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_distill_perf.py \\\n            --manifest benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/distill-perf/manifest.json \\\n            --out-dir \"$tmp\" \\\n            --fail-on-flags\n          python3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_distill_perf.py \\\n            --manifest benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/distill-perf-large/manifest.json \\\n            --out-dir \"$tmp/distill-large\" \\\n            --fail-on-flags\n          python3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_facts_eval.py \\\n            --manifest benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/facts-eval/manifest.json \\\n            --out-dir \"$tmp\" \\\n            --fail-on-flags\n          python3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_release_matrix.py \\\n            --manifest benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/release-matrix/manifest.json \\\n            --out-dir \"$tmp\" \\\n            --fail-on-flags\n          for report in codex-audit-report.json codex-audit-report.md; do\n            committed=\"benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/release/$report\"\n            generated=\"$tmp/$report\"\n            if ! cmp -s \"$committed\" \"$generated\"; then\n              echo \"retained release evidence report is stale: $report\" >&2\n              diff -u \"$committed\" \"$generated\" >&2 || true\n              exit 1\n            fi\n          done\n          for report in radar-tool-audit-report.json radar-tool-audit-report.md; do\n            committed=\"benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/radar-tool/$report\"\n            generated=\"$tmp/$report\"\n            if ! cmp -s \"$committed\" \"$generated\"; then\n              echo \"retained Radar tool evidence report is stale: $report\" >&2\n              diff -u \"$committed\" \"$generated\" >&2 || true\n              exit 1\n            fi\n          done\n          for report in workspace-radar-audit-report.json workspace-radar-audit-report.md; do\n            committed=\"benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/workspace-radar/$report\"\n            generated=\"$tmp/$report\"\n            if ! cmp -s \"$committed\" \"$generated\"; then\n              echo \"retained workspace Radar evidence report is stale: $report\" >&2\n              diff -u \"$committed\" \"$generated\" >&2 || true\n              exit 1\n            fi\n          done\n          for report in distill-perf-audit-report.json distill-perf-audit-report.md; do\n            committed=\"benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/distill-perf/$report\"\n            generated=\"$tmp/$report\"\n            if ! cmp -s \"$committed\" \"$generated\"; then\n              echo \"retained distill performance evidence report is stale: $report\" >&2\n              diff -u \"$committed\" \"$generated\" >&2 || true\n              exit 1\n            fi\n          done\n          for report in facts-eval-audit-report.json facts-eval-audit-report.md; do\n            committed=\"benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/facts-eval/$report\"\n            generated=\"$tmp/$report\"\n            if ! cmp -s \"$committed\" \"$generated\"; then\n              echo \"retained facts eval evidence report is stale: $report\" >&2\n              diff -u \"$committed\" \"$generated\" >&2 || true\n              exit 1\n            fi\n          done\n          for report in release-matrix-report.json release-matrix-report.md; do\n            committed=\"benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/release-matrix/$report\"\n            generated=\"$tmp/$report\"\n            if ! cmp -s \"$committed\" \"$generated\"; then\n              echo \"retained release matrix report is stale: $report\" >&2\n              diff -u \"$committed\" \"$generated\" >&2 || true\n              exit 1\n            fi\n          done\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":168,"oldLines":6,"newStart":168,"newLines":15,"lines":["               exit 1","             fi","           done","+          for report in distill-perf-audit-report.json distill-perf-audit-report.md; do","+            committed=\"benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/distill-perf-large/$report\"","+            generated=\"$tmp/distill-large/$report\"","+            if ! cmp -s \"$committed\" \"$generated\"; then","+              echo \"retained large-repo distill performance evidence report is stale: $report\" >&2","+              diff -u \"$committed\" \"$generated\" >&2 || true","+              exit 1","+            fi","+          done","           for report in facts-eval-audit-report.json facts-eval-audit-report.md; do","             committed=\"benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/facts-eval/$report\"","             generated=\"$tmp/$report\""]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f06e21ce-a69d-41f9-8d7c-ffd2c8fd47a6","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
{"parentUuid":"258c9537-9c5c-49f3-98cd-2456839c7699","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"64","subject":"P0.2 offline: large-repo distill timing on entireio/cli","description":"Run `distill --dry-run --json` (offline) on the entireio/cli large corpus (822 sessions / 1.6G) for real large-repo sizing, plus paired timed --jobs 1 vs --jobs N via --agent command + local-command-agent (deterministic, no model) on a temp brain copy. Produces dry-run.json/jobs-1.json/jobs-N.json with matching cache/timing fields. No hosted-model usage.","activeForm":"Running offline large-repo distill timing","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"65","subject":"P0.2: build distill-perf manifest + pass audit_distill_perf.py","description":"Author a new evidence manifest with a target block for github.com/entireio/cli and widened claim_scope (large-repo command-agent scheduler speedup), retain artifacts + go-test ollama contract, run audit_distill_perf.py to PASS. Then update press release Proven/Pending lines + eval_ledger row + regenerate release-matrix distill track. Honest scope: command-agent measures scheduler parallelism; note hosted-model latency is separate.","activeForm":"Building distill-perf manifest and passing the auditor","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"66","subject":"P0.1 author: harder/clean correctness-axis replay-lab tasks","description":"Author 3-5 candidate tasks where the decisive answer lives in the brain (history rationale / durable fact / semantic locator) and is NOT recoverable from the repo in budget, so no_brain fails (<100%) and brain reliably passes (100%) → clean correctness_win at n>=4. Symptom-level brain_queries (pass brain_query_leak_audit), hide validation+expected, leak_markers + agent_hidden_paths, pinned base_commit. Templates from existing tasks/*.json.","activeForm":"Authoring harder/clean replay-lab tasks","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"67","subject":"P0.1 offline-validate: leak-audit clean + fails-as-expected + panel","description":"For each candidate task: run `run.py check` (offline, no model) to confirm the regression fails-as-expected, and confirm brain_query_leak_audit passes (no answer-bearing identifiers/phrases). Iterate JSON until clean. Build a panel JSON sized for n>=4-8/side. All offline — no hosted-model usage.","activeForm":"Offline-validating tasks (leak-audit + fails-as-expected)","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"68","subject":"P0.1 (post-2PM): run pilots → scale n>=4-8 → check proof_ready","description":"HOSTED-MODEL, run only after 2 PM limit reset. Run no_brain difficulty pilots (confirm baseline fails / score <90), then brain-arm direction pilots, drop saturated tasks, scale survivors to n>=4-8/side, let run.py compute proof_ready. Drives the session-authed claude/codex CLI.","activeForm":"Running pilots and scaling to proof-ready n","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"69","subject":"P0.1 (post-2PM): register genuine proofs or honest negative","description":"If a suite genuinely flips proof_ready: copy into evidence/release/ matching release_citable_suite_globs, flip manifest claim_policy no_release_claim→proof_required with required_proof_scopes, regenerate codex-audit + release-matrix reports, add eval_ledger row, update press release. If it does NOT flip: document the honest negative finding + what was learned. NEVER fabricate numbers.","activeForm":"Registering genuine proofs (or honest negative)","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"70","subject":"Loop-audit until clean (bugbot-proof)","description":"go build/vet/test/gofmt clean; run full `mise run release:readiness` (all auditors + cmp staleness) green; adversarial self-review workflow over new tasks/manifests/docs for leakage, provenance gaps, stale reports, doc-claim mismatches, schema typos, no person-names; loop until dry. Review-before-push (do not push without user review).","activeForm":"Loop-auditing until no issues remain","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"71","subject":"P0.2 wiring: matrix track + mise + CI + press release + ledger","description":"Wire the large-repo distill lane: make audit_release_matrix.py \"target large-repo distill\" track read the new report and flip to proven (scoped to command-agent scheduler speedup at scale); add reports.distill_large to the release-matrix manifest; add mise distill:large:evidence(+:update) into release:readiness; add CI auditor+cmp; update press release Proven/Pending lines; add eval_ledger row. Flag the stale ollama-contract (tests removed from code) finding.","activeForm":"Wiring the large-repo distill lane into matrix/mise/CI/docs","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":8},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5e56204d-d650-4b92-a293-b9540c1b10a4","timestamp":"2026-06-18T17:56:07.824Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
