ll_cmd.go` (`execOllamaDistillAgent`, `isLoopbackHTTPURL`,\n`loopbackOnlyDialContext`), but those named test functions have since been\nremoved from the tree. The auditor validates the retained artifact, not live\ncode, so this does not affect the gate — but the shared contract (used by both\nthe current-repo and large-repo lanes) should be refreshed against current test\nnames as part of release hardening.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b4e6c821-ffa1-4332-8b99-e9bee7ad6e29","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
