{"parentUuid":"6d436726-adae-4564-b8e5-b3a2e51c0908","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_018UxSEJLZWqdXxb3KXGuoDt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed pre-existing/environmental, **not my regression**: `git diff origin/main` shows I never touched `evidence/release/` or `audit_codex.py`, so `release:evidence` (hard_flags from local provenance re-resolution) and `semantic:evidence` (live-brain freshness) fail the same way on clean main in this local environment. **All my P0.2 lanes pass** (`distill:large:evidence`, `release:matrix`, `check`). I'll flag those two as findings.\n\nNow P0.1 (budget reset). Given ultracode + the intricate, parallelizable authoring, I'll launch a workflow to author clean candidate tasks from distinct archetypes — each agent reads real code, drafts a fully-hygienic task, and verifies the decisive answer is in history. I'll validate + run them."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2337,"cache_read_input_tokens":396862,"output_tokens":3905,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2337,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3905,"cache_read_input_tokens":396862,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2337,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2337},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcBATy7wYmzD1TCpvh9U1","type":"assistant","uuid":"6109fb44-9b6c-4e0e-9afb-d9fb16e11d39","timestamp":"2026-06-18T18:03:04.397Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
