{"parentUuid":"57057a29-ae07-46d1-863c-eb891f16f08e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Tobh617ivhdA7K8Rntb5BU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The error is definitive: **\"Your workspace is out of credits\"** — the Codex (gpt-5.5) workspace ran out of credits. The pilot (~16 calls) + the contaminated over-broad run (60+ calls) exhausted it. The pilot ran *while credits were available* (varied, trustworthy results); every run after is an instant no-op failure. Live `codex exec` confirms: out of credits.\n\nSo this is an **access/budget blocker**, not a code or methodology problem. Here's exactly where everything stands:\n\n**P0.2 — DONE** (large-repo distill timing: proven, auditor-clean, wired, bugbot-re-reviewed clean).\n\n**P0.1 — blocked on the proof step by Codex credits.** The trustworthy pilot (Codex, n=2, run before credits ran out) showed:\n- **fact-merge**: brain **2/2**, no_brain **1/2** — a real *directional* brain-lift (the one clean gap).\n- order-cache saturated; value-hook brain raised quality (94 vs 71) but missed the exact value; contract pilot was invalid.\n- The definitive n=4 run to confirm/deny a stable `proof_ready` flip **couldn't complete** — Codex is out of credits.\n\nI won't fabricate a `proof_ready` result, and I won't unilaterally burn your Claude budget on a 8–16-call benchmark run given you flagged it earlier. This is genuinely your call:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1561,"cache_read_input_tokens":582636,"output_tokens":8143,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1561,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":8143,"cache_read_input_tokens":582636,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1561,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1561},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcBGRTeJ4EqD41fU6HXmb","type":"assistant","uuid":"044a844c-7255-4e17-ac0e-12efb600a701","timestamp":"2026-06-18T19:22:04.757Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
