{"parentUuid":"5cefe331-4c9c-47d4-b2b6-07ea627c28d9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Josar9s9PctEaV5SMideZ5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Committed report is clean (0 host-path leaks, proof_ready=1, release_evidence=true). Now the lane README and the wiring. Let me write the README."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2071,"cache_read_input_tokens":663490,"output_tokens":1720,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2071,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1720,"cache_read_input_tokens":663490,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2071,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2071},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcBRzn1op6ReA53HAP22V","type":"assistant","uuid":"159d0dc9-fb62-4100-84dd-a77afda22380","timestamp":"2026-06-18T21:25:56.059Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
{"parentUuid":"159d0dc9-fb62-4100-84dd-a77afda22380","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Josar9s9PctEaV5SMideZ5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012xx411XazXbyqp9LB4MbWe","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/replay-lab-clean/README.md","content":"# Clean replay-lab agent-lift proof (history channel)\n\nThe first retained replay-lab comparison that survives the proof-ready gate.\n\n`mise run clean-proof:evidence` checks it; `mise run clean-proof:evidence:update`\nregenerates the committed audit report.\n\n## What this proves\n\nA clean **correctness-axis** brain-lift on the **history channel**, audited by\n`audit_codex.py` (0 hard integrity flags, 16/16 provenance-backed records):\n\n| task | no_brain | full_brain | verdict | proof_ready |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `entire-brain-clean-default-fact-merge-confidence` | **0/4** | **4/4** | brain_positive (stable) | **true** |\n| `entire-brain-clean-contract-checkpoint-branch-reachability` | 4/4 | 4/4 | saturated | false (retained datapoint) |\n\nRunner: `claude:sonnet:high`, four repetitions per side.\n\nThe fact-merge task regresses a deliberately decided default\n(`defaultFactConfidenceThreshold`, the confidence gate for auto-applying a\ndurable-fact merge/supersede) to a plausible alternative, scrubs the value and\nits rationale from everything the agent can read, and only asks it to \"restore\nthe intended default from project history\". The decided value lives **only** in\nretained session history, so:\n\n- **no_brain (claude:sonnet:high) cannot recover it — 0/4.** It cannot guess the\n  exact arbitrary value; the focused go test passes at several plausible values,\n  so the hidden exact-value check is the sole discriminator.\n- **full_brain recovers it from history and passes — 4/4.** The history channel\n  surfaces the decided value with its rationale; the agent restores it exactly.\n\nThis is a stable `brain_positive` comparison (pass-rate lift surviving the\ndrop-one robustness check at n=4), so `proof_ready=true`.\n\n## Scope — what this does NOT claim\n\nThis lane claims agent lift **only for the history channel, correctness axis,\nwith `claude:sonnet:high`.** It does **not** claim:\n\n- MCP, Radar, semantic, or workspace agent lift, or\n- codex-runner agent lift, or\n- a token/efficiency win.\n\nThose remain `no_release_claim` in `../release` (the B1 clean reruns are\naudit-clean but not proof-ready). The co-located contract-checkpoint comparison\n**saturated** (Sonnet solves it without the brain) and is retained as an honest\nnon-proof-ready datapoint.\n\n## Provenance / why this is a separate lane\n\nThe codex `gpt-5.5` workspace ran out of credits during the proof attempt, so\nthe n=4 confirmation was run with the Claude runner (post-limit-reset). The\nrelease lane (`../release`) is codex-based and stays `no_release_claim` for the\nmcp/radar scopes it still cannot prove; this lane is the honest home for the one\nscope that is now proven. Records are redacted of host paths and contributor\nnames; the suite directory name matches each record's\n`provenance.run_config.suite` so the panel-provenance integrity check passes.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2071,"cache_read_input_tokens":663490,"output_tokens":1720,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2071,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1720,"cache_read_input_tokens":663490,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2071,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2071},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcBRzn1op6ReA53HAP22V","type":"assistant","uuid":"aeda6bde-c935-4100-9cbf-7b691b982552","timestamp":"2026-06-18T21:26:10.777Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
