{"parentUuid":"a082150d-07f4-49db-b50b-459db62e8b1e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b552ce81-e805-4a67-9611-b13d4d2c4854","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019jKeiaVBJVNFHhDZfYJxzb","type":"tool_result","content":"34\t## Known Replay-Lab Outcome\n35\t\n36\tThe retained replay-lab history, MCP-history, and location-only Radar\n37\tagent-lift candidate suites were rerun after the B1 query-hint confound was\n38\tremoved. The retained release lane is now audit-clean with zero hard integrity\n39\tflags, but all three clean comparisons remain `proof_ready=false`: one was\n40\tnoisy/brain-negative, and two were saturated/brain-negative. The release\n41\tevidence lane therefore stays in `no_release_claim` mode. See\n42\t`docs/release-blockers.md` (B1) for the clean suite names and outcomes."}]},"uuid":"7a652072-3fb5-45c7-b5cc-3f85eed839c8","timestamp":"2026-06-18T21:29:28.022Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/docs/release_press_release.md","content":"## Known Replay-Lab Outcome\n\nThe retained replay-lab history, MCP-history, and location-only Radar\nagent-lift candidate suites were rerun after the B1 query-hint confound was\nremoved. The retained release lane is now audit-clean with zero hard integrity\nflags, but all three clean comparisons remain `proof_ready=false`: one was\nnoisy/brain-negative, and two were saturated/brain-negative. The release\nevidence lane therefore stays in `no_release_claim` mode. See\n`docs/release-blockers.md` (B1) for the clean suite names and outcomes.","numLines":9,"startLine":34,"totalLines":114}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a082150d-07f4-49db-b50b-459db62e8b1e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
