{"parentUuid":"76277911-2f2b-48c1-b839-a162f662ff62","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01DknUCThkXJ6972NFsfzM9H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DEXLRgPzaePnwmB2LMCnoH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain\ngit commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\nproof-gap: large-repo distill timing + first proof-ready replay-lab agent-lift\n\nP0.2 — Large-repo distill timing (entireio/cli: 822 sessions / 838 chunks):\n- offline dry-run + paired --jobs 1/4 timed runs via a deterministic\n  diverse-path command-agent on a fresh from-scratch backfill; 2.218x\n  scheduler speedup, reconcile exercised, warning-free, identical\n  serial/parallel output. audit_distill_perf.py PASS.\n- new evidence/distill-perf-large/ lane wired into the release matrix\n  (large-repo extraction-scheduler track -> proven; frontend/hosted-model\n  latency and fact quality kept pending), mise (distill:large:evidence),\n  CI, and the press release.\n- hardened audit_distill_perf.py: validate the executed command-agent\n  (hash-pinned + bound to the run commands, tamper-evident) and enforce\n  serial/parallel reconcile+total equality.\n\nP0.1 — First proof-ready replay-lab agent-lift (0/3 -> 1, history channel):\n- authored 4 harder, clean correctness-axis tasks (leak-audit clean,\n  fails-as-expected).\n- entire-brain-clean-default-fact-merge-confidence: no_brain 0/4 vs\n  full_brain 4/4 (claude:sonnet:high), brain_positive_stable,\n  proof_ready=true; audit_codex.py 0 hard flags, 16/16 provenance-backed.\n  The decided default lives only in retained history, so the agent cannot\n  recover it without the brain.\n- registered as evidence/replay-lab-clean/ with a release-matrix track,\n  mise clean-proof:evidence, CI, an eval-ledger row, and a press-release\n  update. Claim scope is deliberately narrow: history channel, correctness\n  axis, claude:sonnet:high only. MCP, Radar, codex-runner, semantic, and\n  efficiency scopes remain no_release_claim.\n- the other authored tasks are honestly retained as non-proof datapoints:\n  order-cache saturated (no_brain solves from the symptom); value-hook the\n  brain raised quality but missed the exact value; contract saturated.\n\nRecords redacted of host paths and contributor names. Release matrix passes\n(0 flags, release_fully_ready stays false). Codex gpt-5.5 ran out of credits\nduring the proof attempt, so the n=4 confirmation used the Claude runner\nafter the limit reset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nMSG\necho \"commit exit=$?\"\ngit log --oneline -1\ngit status --short | grep -vE '^\\?\\?' | head || echo \"(working tree clean of tracked changes)\"","description":"Commit the proof-gap work locally"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7828,"cache_read_input_tokens":723632,"output_tokens":1608,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7828,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1608,"cache_read_input_tokens":723632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7828,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7828},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcBTuazsi6KhrCQSZTJcb","type":"assistant","uuid":"062ce1e2-7c92-45be-9d7f-db42e55fd322","timestamp":"2026-06-18T21:51:12.569Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
