{"parentUuid":"f3c7b67b-4e4e-46f5-aa15-22ff189ba4d1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011opAVNyQivmr8nfScjo66Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Committed locally** as `263d1d9f` (48 files) — **not pushed**. Working tree clean. The goal is met and the loop-audit converged. Let me record this milestone to memory, then give you the full summary."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1688,"cache_read_input_tokens":731460,"output_tokens":2861,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1688,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2861,"cache_read_input_tokens":731460,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1688,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1688},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcBTxHQHkuSd1fcyXfsn2","type":"assistant","uuid":"7749db6c-a570-4bcc-9f8d-4d70fa215cd9","timestamp":"2026-06-18T21:51:49.598Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
{"parentUuid":"7749db6c-a570-4bcc-9f8d-4d70fa215cd9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011opAVNyQivmr8nfScjo66Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NZzXHE8aBrfr6Hx4pz2xoi","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-Documents-Coding-entire-brain/memory/project-proof-gap-result.md","content":"---\nname: project-proof-gap-result\ndescription: Proof-gap work (branch claude/proof-gap-replay-distill) — first proof-ready replay-lab agent-lift + large-repo distill timing; committed local, not pushed.\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nBranch `claude/proof-gap-replay-distill` (off origin/main fc65f656), commit `263d1d9f`, **committed local, NOT pushed** (awaiting review). Closes both P0 items from [[project-entire-brain-overview]]'s release-readiness gap.\n\n**P0.1 — first proof-ready replay-lab agent-lift (0/3 → 1).** Task `entire-brain-clean-default-fact-merge-confidence` regresses a decided default (`defaultFactConfidenceThreshold = 0.75`) whose value lives only in retained session history; scrubbed from the repo. Result (runner `claude:sonnet:high`, n=4): **no_brain 0/4, full_brain 4/4, brain_positive_stable, proof_ready=true**, `audit_codex.py` 0 hard flags. Registered as `evidence/replay-lab-clean/` (a SEPARATE lane, claim_policy proof_required) + a release-matrix track `[proven] claimable=true`. **Scope is deliberately narrow: history channel, correctness axis, claude:sonnet:high only** — mcp/radar/codex/semantic/efficiency stay `no_release_claim` in `evidence/release`. The other 3 authored tasks are honest non-proofs: order-cache saturated, value-hook brain raised quality but missed the exact value, contract saturated. **Why Claude not Codex:** the codex gpt-5.5 workspace ran out of credits mid-proof; pilot (codex, pre-credit-exhaustion) was the trustworthy directional signal.\n\n**P0.2 — large-repo distill timing proven.** entireio/cli brain (822 sessions / 838 chunks, found locally) → `distill --dry-run` + paired `--jobs 1/4` via a deterministic diverse-path command-agent (`evidence/distill-perf-large/large_command_agent.py`); fresh from-scratch backfill, **2.218× scheduler speedup**, warning-free, reconcile exercised, identical serial/parallel output. New `evidence/distill-perf-large/` lane; matrix track `large-repo distill extraction-scheduler speedup` → proven; **frontend/hosted-model latency+fact-quality kept pending** (command-agent ≠ hosted model). Hardened `audit_distill_perf.py`: validates the executed agent (hash-pinned, tamper-evident) + enforces serial/parallel reconcile/total equality.\n\n**Pre-existing findings flagged (NOT mine):** `release:evidence` + `semantic:evidence` fail LOCALLY only (provenance re-resolution against local checkout; live-brain freshness) — committed artifacts are clean and pass on a canonical CI checkout. The shared ollama go-test contract pins tests removed from the tree (functionality remains; removed for a known race) — disclosed in the distill-perf-large README.\n\nLoop-audit: 2 adversarial workflow rounds; round 1 found a real matrix-staleness blocker + provenance/equality majors (all fixed + verified); round 2 found only 2 cosmetic nits (fixed); the proof was independently re-audited as real + not gamed. **Gotcha: the shared checkout's concurrent Codex agent + concurrent review workflows twice reverted/regenerated committed reports — never run benchmark agent runs or report-regenerating reviews concurrently; regenerate canonically (`mise run *:evidence:update`) after.** See [[project-cli-proof-v3-honest]] for the broader brain-lift-is-narrow context.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1688,"cache_read_input_tokens":731460,"output_tokens":2861,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1688,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2861,"cache_read_input_tokens":731460,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1688,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1688},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcBTxHQHkuSd1fcyXfsn2","type":"assistant","uuid":"d1e46abf-81f2-44c6-9ba5-ab31e940ea77","timestamp":"2026-06-18T21:52:05.207Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
