 — entireio/cli 360-run brain-vs-no-brain proof done properly; result + the rg/sessions/command-restructure gotchas behind the old \"0/3\".\n- [CLI proof v3 (honest)](project-cli-proof-v3-honest.md) — post-review re-run; brain = Claude quality+efficiency win, Codex efficiency-only; GPT quality is the open problem.\n- [Opus compact mode + GPT-5.5 MCP fix](project-opus-compact-mode.md) — Opus compact delivery (PR #3, MERGED); then GPT-5.5 MCP FIXED via \"disciplined MCP\" (brief+one brain_history+hard stop): pass-rate 88%→100%, review 4/5→5/5 (PR #4 OPEN, branch agent-brain-gpt-mcp-fix). mini high/xhigh −32% tok.\n- [Regression Radar](project-regression-radar.md) — brain-as-active-reviewer (inspect regressions + brain_regressions MCP); precise changed-detection (0 false alarms), deletions noisy/opt-in; branch claude/regression-radar, no PR, awaiting Thomas's take.\n- [Disciplined MCP delivery (detail)](project-disciplined-mcp-delivery.md) — review/internals of PR #4: wants_disciplined_mcp routing + audit-floor consistency; root cause = brief's compound-query history dilutes precise identifiers; merge-ready, corroborates durable-facts retrieval gap.\n- [No Thomas name in artifacts](feedback-no-thomas-name-in-artifacts.md) — never name the CEO in commits, regente posts, reviews, or role labels; describe roles neutrally.\n- [Layer-B scenarios](project-layer-b-scenarios.md) — PR #34: Layer B 0→10 candidates (5 new verified), one-row-per-task ledger fix, pinned da68cb8f; ~19 areas resumable via workflow wf_58e53225-098.\n- [Codex shared checkout](project-codex-shared-checkout.md) — Codex agent edits the same checkout live; deliver from clean worktrees based on origin/<branch>, extract own hunks, git apply -R to clean up.\n- [Review before push](feedback-review-before-push.md) — never push/open a PR without the user reviewing diff + message first; \"push\" in a goal means prepare-to-push, then stop for approval.\n- [Checkpoint remote fetch](project-checkpoint-remote-fetch.md) — entireio/cli history IS fetchable: .entire settings checkpoint_remote → entireio/cli-checkpoints via refresh/export (sanctioned egress); github-cli stays history-less.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":7,"lines":[" # Memory Index"," "," - [entire-brain overview](project-entire-brain-overview.md) — local \"brain\" plugin for the Entire CLI, built from 4 knowledge sources (sessions/seed/semantic/history), all no-egress.","+- [Proof-gap result](project-proof-gap-result.md) — branch claude/proof-gap-replay-distill (commit 263d1d9f, local not pushed): first proof-ready replay-lab agent-lift (fact-merge, history channel, claude:sonnet:high, 0/4→4/4) + large-repo distill timing (entireio/cli, 2.218×); honest narrow scope; 2-round bugbot loop-audit clean."," - [Benchmark Phase 2 status](project-benchmark-phase2-status.md) — Phase 1 done; Phase 2 benchmark reset 2026-06-02 for scenario overcount; model-attribution caveat."," - [Active branch: benchmark-proof](project-active-branch-benchmark-proof.md) — agent-brain harness + integrity auditor; uncommitted make_report.py infra-failure filter."," - [CLI proof result](project-cli-proof-result.md) — entireio/cli 360-run brain-vs-no-brain proof done properly; result + the rg/sessions/command-restructure gotchas behind the old \"0/3\"."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c986df20-8cd7-483c-b3c7-4d694cc32543","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain","sessionId":"af861ed9-9e1d-41a7-8400-b53c2995aed8","version":"2.1.177","gitBranch":"claude/proof-gap-replay-distill","slug":"zippy-floating-lovelace"}
