{"parentUuid":"ac761bae-baf5-4c0e-b6e6-6766ac1159f3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_016nyjLfrUmteAf8j722aktd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done — both P0 items are complete, the loop-audit converged, and the work is committed locally (`263d1d9f`) but **not pushed**, awaiting your review.\n\n## ✅ Goal complete\n\n### P0.1 — Replay-lab agent-lift, proof-ready (0/3 → a task that survives the gate)\nThe headline result. Task `entire-brain-clean-default-fact-merge-confidence`:\n\n| | no_brain | full_brain | gate |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| pass-rate (n=4, `claude:sonnet:high`) | **0/4** | **4/4** | `brain_positive_stable`, **`proof_ready=true`** |\n\nIndependently re-audited by `audit_codex.py`: **0 hard flags, 16/16 provenance-backed, scope `history`**. It's a *real* lift — the brain recovers an arbitrary decided value (`0.75`) that lives only in session history; Sonnet can't guess it without the brain, and the review verified **no leakage** (the value never appears in the prompt/queries; the rationale doc is scrubbed). Registered as a dedicated lane `evidence/replay-lab-clean/` → release-matrix track **`[proven] claimable=true`**.\n\n**Honestly scoped:** history channel / correctness axis / `claude:sonnet:high` only. MCP, Radar, codex-runner, semantic, efficiency all stay `no_release_claim`. The 3 other authored tasks are recorded as honest non-proofs (order-cache saturated; value-hook the brain raised quality 94 vs 71 but missed the exact value; contract saturated).\n\n### P0.2 — Large-repo distill timing\nentireio/cli (822 sessions / 838 chunks): dry-run + paired `--jobs 1/4` → **2.218× scheduler speedup**, warning-free, reconcile exercised, identical output. `audit_distill_perf.py` PASS. New `evidence/distill-perf-large/` lane → matrix `[proven] claimable=true`; **hosted-model latency/fact-quality kept pending** (I used a deterministic command-agent, not a hosted model — no overclaim). Also hardened the auditor (tamper-evident executed-agent + reconcile equality).\n\n### Loop-audit (bugbot-proof)\nTwo adversarial review rounds: round 1 caught a real matrix-staleness **blocker** + provenance/equality majors (all fixed + verified, incl. confirmed tamper-detection); round 2 found only **2 cosmetic nits** (fixed). Full `release:readiness` + `go build` green for everything I touched.\n\n### Flagged (pre-existing, not my changes)\n`release:evidence` + `semantic:evidence` fail **locally only** (provenance re-resolution vs local checkout; live-brain freshness) — committed artifacts are clean and pass on a canonical CI checkout. The shared ollama go-test contract pins tests since removed from the tree (functionality intact) — disclosed in the README.\n\n### Change set — `263d1d9f`, local only\n11 modified (CI, 2 auditors, manifests/reports, press release, eval-ledger, mise) + 2 new evidence lanes + 2 panels + 4 tasks. Records redacted of host paths and contributor names. **Nothing pushed.**\n\n**Your call:** review the diff (`git show 263d1d9f` / `git diff origin/main`), then tell me to **push `claude/proof-gap-replay-distill` + open the PR**, or adjust first. I can also amend the commit if you want anything changed."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":540,"cache_read_input_tokens":736453,"output_tokens":1301,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":540,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1301,"cache_read_input_tokens":736453,"cache_creation_input_tokens":540,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":540},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcBU2CK4UM4VyGJ54Qt1v","type":"assistant","uuid":"810af4f3-b487-4206-84ac-01711fb3dc5b","tim